        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(pin (num \"13\") (name \"LAN_PORT3_TX+\") (type \"bidirectional\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "U5 | SKYLAB SKW92A (`SKW92A:SKW92A`) | Main compute / WiFi radio / 5-port Ethernet switch"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If the Ethernet switch enables port 3, its TX differential pair is shorted to ground, causing loss of Ethernet operation on that port and potentially excessive current or PHY damage. Even if the port is unused, this is a connectivity deviation from the intended design.",
      "confidence": 0.72
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files show a clear short-to-ground of the SKW92A LAN_PORT3_TX+/- Ethernet PHY pins, which is not described as intended by the specification and would affect Ethernet PHY behavior."
